@startuml
title Sequence - Workspace Window Capture

participant "WorkspaceListener\nAuto-save" as Listener
participant "WorkspaceItem" as Item
participant "Chrome APIs" as Chrome
participant "WorkspaceService" as Service
participant "WorkspaceStore" as Store
database "chrome.storage.local" as Storage

Listener -> Listener: scheduleSave(windowId)\n[500ms debounce]

Listener -> Item: captureWindowSnapshot(windowId)

Item -> Chrome: query chrome.windows.get(windowId)
Chrome --> Item: window object

Item -> Chrome: query chrome.tabs.query({windowId})
Chrome --> Item: tabs[] array

Item -> Chrome: query chrome.tabGroups.query({windowId})
Chrome --> Item: tabGroups[] array

Item -> Item: for each tab:
Item -> Item:   extract url, title, active\n  pinned, index, favIconUrl\n  discarded, groupId

Item -> Item: for each tabGroup:
Item -> Item:   extract title, color\n  collapsed status\n  create StoredGroup

Item -> Item: build StoredTab[] array
Item -> Item: build StoredGroup[] array
Item -> Item: set updatedAt timestamp

Item --> Listener: snapshot complete

Listener -> Service: notifySaveRequired()
Service -> Service: update workspaceMap\nwith modified WorkspaceItem

Service -> Store: SaveToStorage()
Store -> Store: acquire mutex
Store -> Storage: set(STORAGE_KEY, state)
Storage --> Store: ok
Store -> Store: release mutex
Store --> Service: save complete

@enduml
